            "notes": "闲聊：intent 应为 chitchat 且不挂知识库检索。"
        },
        {
            "id": "qa-014",
            "intent": "web",
            "question": "帮我查一下今天上海的天气",
            "expected_doc_titles": [],
            "expected_key_points": [],
            "notes": "联网：intent 应为 web 或 knowledge_then_web；未配 Tavily 时应如实说明搜索不可用。"
